![banner](https://github.com/OrionOS-Project/.github/blob/main/profile/banner/orion-organization-profile.png)

### Create a directory for the source files
```
mkdir OrionOS
cd OrionOS
```
### Initializing Repo
```
repo init -u https://github.com/OrionOS-Project/manifest -b vic --git-lfs
```

### Sync sources
```
repo sync -c --no-clone-bundle --optimized-fetch --prune -j$(nproc --all)
```

### Run your build
```
. build/envsetup.sh
lunch orion_<product_name>-<release_type>-<build_variant>
make orion -j$(nproc --all)
```

### OrionOS Flags
```
ORION_MAINTAINER := Unknown
ORION_MAINTAINER_LINK := https://t*me/username
ORION_BUILD_TYPE := Unofficial
ORION_GAPPS := true
TARGET_BOOT_ANIMATION_RES := 720/1080/1440
# for devices that support udfps
TARGET_HAS_UDFPS := true
# Bootanimation for pixel device
TARGET_PIXEL_BOOT_ANIMATION_RES := 1080/1440
```
